<h3><u>Abbas meer-e-karwan</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Abbas meer-e-karwan</u></strong></p>

<p>(Kaarwaan) x6</p>

<p>Yasrab se suwe karbala</p>

<p>ik karwaan rukhsat huwa</p>

<p>Sar pe alam saaya fighan</p>

<p>Ghazi ki aati hai sada</p>

<p>Pehla safar zainab ka hai</p>

<p>Sunsaan kardo raasta</p>

<p>[(Kaarewaan) x2 Abbas meer-e-karwaan] x2</p>

<ol>
 <li>Kya shaan he kya dab daba
 <p>Kya log hein quraanuma</p>

 <p>Salle ala sale ala ayaat ka he qaafla</p>

 <p>Mashko alam inka nishaan</p>

 <p>Abbas meere karwaan</p>

 <p>[(Kaarewaan) x2 Abbas meer-e-karwaan] x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Allah ke pyaare hein ye
 <p>Aale nabi saare hein ye</p>

 <p>Quran ke pare hein ye</p>

 <p>Kaunain ke tare hein ye</p>

 <p>Zere qadam he asmaan</p>

 <p>Abbas meere karwaan</p>

 <p>[(Kaarewaan) x2 Abbas meer-e-karwaan] x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Koi shabih-e-Mustafa
 <p>Koi hasan ka dilruba</p>

 <p>Hai koi aks-e-sayyeda</p>

 <p>Shabbir ka ye qaafila</p>

 <p>Thaame alam jo hai jawaan</p>

 <p>Abbas meere karwaan</p>

 <p>[(Kaarewaan) x2 Abbas meer-e-karwaan] x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Yasrib se taba karbala
 <p>Har din tawaafe kaafila</p>

 <p>Abbas karta hi raha</p>

 <p>Parde ka zimmedaar tha</p>

 <p>Yun mutmain thi bibiyaan</p>

 <p>Abbas meere karwaan</p>

 <p>[(Kaarewaan) x2 Abbas meer-e-karwaan] x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Abbas woh kirdaar he
 <p>Baade ali salaar hai</p>

 <p>Aysa alam bardaar hai</p>

 <p>Maydan mein be talwar he</p>

 <p>Phir bhi alam ka paasbaan</p>

 <p>Abbas meere karwaan</p>

 <p>[(Kaarewaan) x2 Abbas meer-e-karwaan] x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Lo agaya uska alam
 <p>Ghazi jise kehte hein hum</p>

 <p>Kehte chalo ye dambadam</p>

 <p>Abbas meer-e-lashkaram</p>

 <p>Babul hawaaij mehrabaan</p>

 <p>Abbas meere karwaan</p>

 <p>[(Kaarewaan) x2 Abbas meer-e-karwaan] x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Jab shaam pohoncha qafla
 <p>Khutba ye zainab ne diya</p>

 <p>Sunle ye qaum-e-ashkiya</p>

 <p>Hum hein bina-e-lailaah</p>

 <p>Kashti he dee(n) hum baadbaa(n)</p>

 <p>Abbas meere karwaan</p>

 <p>[(Kaarewaan) x2 Abbas meer-e-karwaan] x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>Tha hashr mein mola ali</li>
</ol>

<p>Ye &quot;sarwar-o-rehan&quot; bhi</p>

<p>Nazre karam se aapki</p>

<p>Rakhte hein ummeed-e-qawi</p>

<p>Nawhon se denge ye bayaan</p>

<p>Abbas meere karwaan</p>

<p>[(Kaarewaan) x2 Abbas meer-e-karwaan] x2</p>
</p>